  "_comment": "EmbeddingGemma 2 for the Neural Engine (owner 2026-10-09): the pinned files api/services/model_fetch.py downloads once into $CICADA_HOME/models/<dir_name>, each checked against its sha256 and size before anything is installed. Only the text encoder: the audio and vision encoders in the same repository are never fetched. Bump `revision` and every hash together, and give `dir_name` a new value with them: macOS caches the Neural Engine compile against the compiled model's path, so a new revision must never land at an old path.",
